#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:1
msgid "E4222"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `invalid_lexscan_target`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`invalid_lexscan_target`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:5
msgid "Invalid lexical matching target."
msgstr "无效的词法匹配目标。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:7
msgid ""
"`lexmatch` accepts an in-memory `String` or `StringView`. `lexscan` "
"accepts an in-memory `@lexbuf.StringScanner`, a synchronous "
"`@lexbuf.Lexbuf`, or an asynchronous `@lexbuf.AsyncLexbuf`. A `String` or"
" `StringView` value is not a valid `lexscan` target; use `lexmatch` for "
"one in-memory match, or construct a `StringScanner` to maintain a cursor "
"between scans. Other values, such as numbers or user-defined lexbuf-like "
"types, cannot be matched by these expressions."
msgstr ""
"`lexmatch` 接受内存中的 `String` 或 `StringView`。`lexscan` 接受内存中的 "
"`@lexbuf.StringScanner`、同步的 `@lexbuf.Lexbuf` 或异步的 `@lexbuf.AsyncLexbuf`。"
"`String` 或 `StringView` 值不是有效的 `lexscan` 目标；如只需对一个内存值进行匹配，请使用 "
"`lexmatch`，如需在多次扫描之间维护游标，请构造 "
"`StringScanner`。数字或用户自定义的类词法缓冲区类型等其他值不能由这些表达式匹配。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:15
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:17
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn scan_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexscan text with longest {\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:21
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:23
msgid ""
"Use `lexmatch` with a string-like value, or create a `StringScanner`, "
"`Lexbuf`, or `AsyncLexbuf` for `lexscan`."
msgstr ""
"请对字符串类型的值使用 `lexmatch`，或者为 `lexscan` 创建 `StringScanner`、`Lexbuf` 或 "
"`AsyncLexbuf`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:26
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
